59
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:44,933
Then comes scriptwriting

60
00:01:44,933 --> 00:01:47,766
Back in the day, a 5-minute video was already considered pretty long

61
00:01:49,766 --> 00:01:50,966
But now for long-form videos

62
00:01:50,966 --> 00:01:53,200
