64
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,233
As for the specific process

65
00:01:55,233 --> 00:01:57,800
Like this room tour video you're watching right now

66
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,166
I first lock down the title

67
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:03,600
Which is the main question my video wants to answer

68
00:02:03,633 --> 00:02:05,033
Then I write the outline

69
00:02:05,033 --> 00:02:07,100
What specific topics the video will cover

70
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:07,800
Because it's a room tour

71
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,866
I also have to consider at the same time

72
00:02:08,866 --> 00:02:10,400
Whether its circulation path is smooth

73
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:13,100
And then explain those topics clearly

74
00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:15,133
Of course, this is the most basic structure of a video

75
00:02:15,133 --> 00:02:15,766
As you all know

76
00:02:15,766 --> 00:02:18,000
Our channel's videos are a bit special

77
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,933
Niche but not that niche

78
00:02:19,933 --> 00:02:23,666
Spanning tech, digital, gaming, DIY, science popularization, and life

79
00:02:23,666 --> 00:02:24,533
Plus music

80
00:02:25,866 --> 00:02:26,966
The type of video being made differs

81
00:02:26,966 --> 00:02:29,300
The focus of the writing should also be different

82
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:30,566
Is to properly explain one matter clearly

83
00:02:30,566 --> 00:02:31,933
Or to mess around and play with memes

84
00:02:31,933 --> 00:02:33,600
Or is live reaction needed on site

85
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:36,100
And also those kinds of re-production, re-shooting, re-stage-managing ones

86
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:36,733
There is a bit of everything

87
00:02:36,733 --> 00:02:39,200
For me, a lot of the experiences are very fresh

88
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:41,366
There is pressure but it is also quite fun

89
00:02:41,366 --> 00:02:42,366
Of course, this also means

90
00:02:42,366 --> 00:02:45,133
The difference from most bloggers in the digital zone is

91
00:02:45,133 --> 00:02:46,400
Our aroll shooting

92
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:49,000
Actually every time requires re-setting the scene

93
00:02:50,433 --> 00:02:53,400
