96
00:02:56,933 --> 00:02:57,700
The first step

97
00:02:58,933 --> 00:03:00,533
Find a suitable background

98
00:03:00,533 --> 00:03:01,966
Create a sense of depth as much as possible

99
00:03:01,966 --> 00:03:03,933
Best to have a feeling of the passage of time

100
00:03:03,933 --> 00:03:05,166
That is, there are windows

101
00:03:05,166 --> 00:03:05,900
After finding it

102
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:06,666
The second step

103
00:03:07,433 --> 00:03:09,433
For this episode's video I need to convey a sense of approachability

104
00:03:09,433 --> 00:03:11,300
Better to add some scene lights

105
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,600
Finally

106
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,166
