00:03:18,433 --> 00:03:19,933
Then we can shoot

111
00:03:20,933 --> 00:03:22,966
Five years ago the cost of making videos was relatively low

112
00:03:22,966 --> 00:03:25,133
Many people made videos while also working their day jobs

113
00:03:25,133 --> 00:03:25,833
Back then

114
00:03:25,833 --> 00:03:27,533
