115
00:03:27,533 --> 00:03:28,300
But now

116
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:30,433
The production cost of the entire industry is rising

117
00:03:30,433 --> 00:03:32,933
Only with a source of income can one keep making videos

118
00:03:32,933 --> 00:03:33,566
Taking on commercial commissions

119
00:03:33,566 --> 00:03:34,800
Apart from content creation

120
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:37,000
The ability that must be learned and mastered

121
00:03:38,233 --> 00:03:39,766
What everyone imagines doing commercial commissions to be like

122
00:03:39,766 --> 00:03:42,033
is different from what doing commercial commissions is actually like

123
00:03:42,033 --> 00:03:43,666
Some things you assume are commercial commissions

124
00:03:43,666 --> 00:03:44,733
really aren't commercial commissions

125
00:03:44,733 --> 00:03:46,033
Especially in the gaming category

126
00:03:46,033 --> 00:03:47,000
For example, a while back

127
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,333
the game *Wuchang: Fallen Feathers* that got creators cursed for "selling out for dirty money"

128
00:03:49,333 --> 00:03:50,533
As far as I know

129
00:03:50,533 --> 00:03:51,533
99%

130
00:03:51,533 --> 00:03:52,600
were not commercial commissions

131
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,400
There was no money received

132
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,800
Really, no money was taken

133
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,566
Another thing that's rather mind-bending is

134
00:03:56,566 --> 00:03:59,166
a commercial commission video does not equal one that's meant to sell products

135
00:03:59,166 --> 00:04:01,166
The clients' demands are bizarre and varied

136
00:04:01,166 --> 00:04:02,400
Some do want to sell products

137
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,733
but there are also those who want brand publicity

138
00:04:04,733 --> 00:04:06,666
want to promote a certain kind of technology

139
00:04:06,666 --> 00:04:07,966
want to do something viral and break out of their circle

140
00:04:07,966 --> 00:04:10,500
or just want a certain word repeated over and over

141
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:11,600
All of it exists, everything exists

142
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:13,766
So a good commercial commission is hard to come by

143
00:04:13,766 --> 00:04:15,333
It's already not easy to hit it off at first try

